# Opsera Node Backend Service

This is a consolidated Helm chart that combines the following Node.js backend services (non-orchestration parts):
1. nodeapi (non-orchestration parts)
2. opsera-nodejs-api-integrator-service
3. opsera-backstage-integrator-service
4. opsera-node-blueprints-logs-service
5. opsera-pipeline-settings-operations (API parts)

## Purpose
This consolidated service reduces operational overhead by combining multiple related backend services into a single deployable unit.

## Environment-Specific Values Files
- values-opsera-test-microservices.yaml
- values-opsera-uat-microservices.yaml
- values-opsera-prod-microservices.yaml
- values-opsera-sandbox-microservices.yaml
- values-honeywell-platform-microservices.yaml
- values-honeywell-sandbox-microservices.yaml
- values-workday-platform-microservices.yaml

## Deployment
```bash
helm upgrade --install opsera-node-backend-service . \
  -f values-<environment>-microservices.yaml \
  --namespace <namespace>
```




